</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/976/G097651/20261005028/">
<ns1:title>"Hungry Horrors," a deck-building adventure game where you serve food instead of fighting monsters, will release its official Version 1.0 on October 13</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/976/G097651/20261005028/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T20:00:00+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　ClumsyBearStudio announced today (October 9, 2026) that it will release the official Version 1.0 of “Hungry Horrors,” currently in Early Access on Steam, on October 13. The price is 1,700 yen (tax included). This deck-building adventure game challenges players to serve meals to monsters and satisfy them before they eat the player.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/987/G098799/20261009042/">
<ns1:title>What secrets lie hidden in a town overrun by monsters? The Metroidvania-style survival horror game “Silver Pines” is now available.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/987/G098799/20261009042/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T19:58:34+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Team17 released "SilverPines," a new title developed by WychElm, today (October 9, 2026). Set in a small American town, this Metroidvania-style survival horror game follows private detective Red Walker as he uncovers secrets hidden in the darkness.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/014/G101487/20261009044/">
<ns1:title>School by day, demon hunting by night. “Catechesis,” a horror RPG from the developers of “Yuppie Psycho,” is set for release in the summer of 2027—more than 10 years in the making.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/014/G101487/20261009044/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T19:50:27+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　BaroqueDecay has announced that it will release the PC horror RPG “Catechesis” in the summer of 2027. Development on the title was suspended after its initial announcement in 2013, but it has now been revived after more than 10 years. In addition, an update has been released for the demo currently available.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/882/G088214/20261009043/">
