<ns1:description>
　The game development club Yako-ken today launched the Steam store page for its PC game “Mame-Kasu-chan: A Girl Who Randomly Shares Trivia and Trivial Lies.” This fully voiced adventure game challenges players to expose the trivial lies told by “Mame-Kasu-chan,” a mysterious girl who spouts one surprising piece of trivia after another.
</ns1:description>
