<ns1:description>
　Paradox Interactive has announced two new content creator packs for *Cities: Skylines*: “Mansions &amp; Manors” and “Holiday Getaways.” Both are scheduled for release on October 28, 2026, for PC, PlayStation, and Xbox. In addition, the in-game radio station “Blueprint Beats Radio” will launch on the same day.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/758/G075801/20261009016/">
<ns1:title>New artists featured on “Grand Theft Auto VI: The Album” have been revealed. Cardi B and Fuerza Regida have been confirmed to be on the album.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/758/G075801/20261009016/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T14:31:12+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　On October 9, 2026, Rockstar Games announced that “Grand Theft Auto VI: The Album” will feature “Don’t Chart” by rapper Cardi B and “Suzuki” by the music group Fuerza Regida. This album is the soundtrack for “Grand Theft Auto VI,” which the company plans to release on November 19.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/002/G100266/20261009012/">
<ns1:title>Get the devil who loves you so much he wants to kill you completely drunk. The Russian roulette-style drinking survival game “PUKEY GODDESS SHOT TRICK” is set to be released on December 8.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/002/G100266/20261009012/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T14:17:08+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Alliance Arts announced today that the PC game “PUKEYGODDESSSHOTTRICK” will be released on December 8, 2026. The price is 666 yen (tax included). This game is a Russian roulette-style drinking survival game in which you engage in a high-stakes game of wits against a demon who loves you so much it wants to kill you—a battle to see who will vomit their soul first.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/426/G042651/20261005004/">
<ns1:title>It’s okay to create a “world for the world,” not just a world for games. Eric Shai and Fumito Ueda Discuss Game Design [The Tenth Mosaic]</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/426/G042651/20261005004/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T14:13:20+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　How did *The Outer Worlds* influence the concept of “holding hands” in *ICO*? Eric Shai and Fumito Ueda explored the commonalities in their creative approaches, including nonverbal expression, dealing with technical constraints, and game design that prioritizes the world.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/049/G104900/20261009013/">
<ns1:title>"Hololive Mahjong -Holojan-" has begun accepting pre-registrations. A total of 37 Hololive talents will participate, and players can choose their favorite and enjoy playing mahjong with them.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/049/G104900/20261009013/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T13:40:33+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Today, Cover announced “Hololive Mahjong – Holojan –,” a collaborative title with Aiming, and began accepting pre-registrations. This game is Hololive’s first mahjong title, featuring a total of 37 talents from the female VTuber group “Hololive.” It is scheduled for release later this year on PC, browser, iOS, and Android.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999901/20261009006/">
<ns1:title>A book of over 200 pages chronicling the nostalgic "ZX Spectrum" computer is currently being crowdfunded. Covering everything from its inception to recent compatible models, the campaign reached its funding goal in 98 minutes.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/999/G999901/20261009006/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T13:09:40+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　A crowdfunding campaign on Kickstarter for “The Rubber-Keyed Wonder: The Sinclair ZX Spectrum Story”—a book of over 200 pages chronicling the history of the nostalgic “ZX Spectrum” computer—is currently underway until November 2, 2026, at 8:57 p.m. The book covers not only the past but also recent compatible models.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/048/G104897/20261009011/">
<ns1:title>"Girls &amp; Panzer: All-Star Tank Carnival," a game for the Nintendo Switch 2, is set to be released sometime in 2027</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/048/G104897/20261009011/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T13:01:22+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　D3 Publisher announced today (October 9, 2026) that it will release the Switch 2 game “Girls &amp; Panzer All-Star Tank Carnival” sometime in 2027. The price has not yet been determined. The game reportedly retains the drift action from “Girls &amp; Panzer: Dream Tank Match” while featuring enhanced graphics and visual effects.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/865/G086555/20261009010/">
<ns1:title>Set in a world where supernatural phenomena beyond human understanding have become part of everyday life, the mystery adventure game “Angel Organization: Executive Division, Soul Salvation Section”—in which a pair of public security officers investigate “spirit-related incidents”—has released a demo version.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/865/G086555/20261009010/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T12:51:29+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Circle Yokuniku has released a demo version of its PC mystery adventure game, "Angel Organization Executive Department: Soul Salvation Division," on Steam. The game follows a pair of partners investigating "spiritual harm incidents" that defy human understanding. In the demo, players can experience the game's investigation and deduction mechanics, as well as its unique system for viewing the memories of spirits.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/048/G104889/20261009007/">
<ns1:title>The action adventure game "Waltz and Jam" is set for release on December 3. Join a transforming puppy on an adventure through an afterlife that reinterprets the Seven Deadly Sins.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/048/G104889/20261009007/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T12:43:16+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　KRAFTON announced today that it will release “Waltz &amp; Jam” for PC, Switch 2, and PS5 on December 3. Set in an afterlife that reimagines the Seven Deadly Sins, this action-adventure game follows the adventures of “Waltz,” an innocent soul, and “Jam,” an adorable puppy. Players progress by combining their respective abilities.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/964/G096496/20261009003/">
<ns1:title>"Resequence: The Orchard," an ensemble-style adventure game that uses counseling sessions to uncover the truth behind supernatural phenomena and the disappearance of a wife, has released a demo on Steam.</ns1:title>
