<dc:date>2026-10-09T12:18:17+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Clearreve released a demo version of its PC game “Resequence: The Orchard” on Steam today. This game is an ensemble adventure title that depicts the terror of supernatural phenomena encroaching on everyday life. In the demo, players can experience “Record of Circumstances Leading to Consultation Work” by Raikichi Saito and “Counseling: Session 1” by Sogo Bon.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/908/G090883/20261009009/">
<ns1:title>"Out of Sight," a horror adventure game in which a girl who has just regained her sight aims to escape from a dangerous mansion, and "TerraScape," a city-building puzzle game where you build a medieval-style kingdom on a floating island, are currently available for free on the Epic Games Store.</ns1:title>
<ns1:link>https://www.4gamer.net/games/908/G090883/20261009009/</ns1:link>
<dc:date>2026-10-09T12:09:43+09:00</dc:date>
<ns1:description>
　Epic Games is offering "Out of Sight" and "TerraScape" for free on its PC game distribution platform, the Epic Games Store. The promotion runs until 12:00 a.m. on October 16, 2026.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/029/G002975/20260921064/">
