　Izanagi Games announced today (October 9, 2026) that the Steam version of “AKIBALOST,” whose release had been delayed, will be released on October 21. Additionally, as a gesture of apology and gratitude to players, the discount rate for the two-week-long launch sale will be increased from 10% to 20%.
</ns1:description>
</ns1:item>

	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/802/G080235/20261008054/">
