	<ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.4gamer.net/games/484/G048410/20261009002/">
<ns1:title>The Switch version of "Hogwarts Legacy" (main game + DLC set) is an incredibly low price of 987 yen! "LEGO City: Undercover" is 457 yen! "Last-Minute Sale Info for This Week"</ns1:title>
